-- CAPABILITY ------------- errors/capture_escape_4.march

`h` cannot leave the `File.with_open` callback, but the message that holds it is sent to an actor. [capture_escape]

14 |     let _ = File.with_open("notes.txt", fn h -> send(keeper, Keep(h)))
                                                     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^

    `h` is a scoped handle: it is only good until the `File.with_open` callback returns (line 14).
    Read what you need inside the callback and return the data instead.
    run `march --explain capture_escape`


